...                                    |        for missing CAclass inside WTS configuraiotn
...               16-Nov-2021          |        UE_CAPA and EUTRA allignment with new Samsung capabilities	
...               26-Nov-2021          |        Remove test mode from AirphoneConfig.xml
...                                    |        After doing some trials, behaviour semms now be ok on AP side
...                                    |        when there is no MIMO capabilities (i.e.: only 1L). In this case
...                                    |        I can see that the is no RI reported and call is OK
...                                    |        It seems also ok in case of 2 layers capabilities. The default
...                                    |        for RI is by default one => OK. So, AirphoneConfig.xml and also
...                                    |        egate test modes seems not useful. Test was done by emptying AirphoneConfig.xml
...                                    |        file and also with default one.
